<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="1JN" style="id">1 Johan</book>
  <para style="h">1 Johan</para>
  <para style="toc1">1 Johan</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Johan</para>
  <para style="mt">1 Johan</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hinna thu, a tung a kipan a omkhinsa, koute’n ka zak uh, ka mit ua ka muh uh, ka et kilkel ua, ka khut ua ka khoih uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huai hinna latsak in a hong omta a, koute’n ka mu uhi, huai tangtawn hinna, Pa kiang a om leh koute kiang ah latsak a om noute kiang ah k’on phuang uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Koute’n ka muh sa uh leh ka zaksa uh mah noute kiang ah k’on phuang uhi, huchi a noute’n leng koute toh kithuahna na neih theihna ding un; koute kithuahna bel Pa toh Tapa Jesu Khrist toh kithuahna ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Noute na kipahna uh a bukimna ding in hiai k’on gelh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huan thukhah a kiang a kipan a ka zak uh na kiang ua k’on hilhsawn uh hiai ahi; Pathian zaw vak ahi a, amah ah mial a omkei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mial a om napi in Amah ka kithuahpih chi lehang zuau i gen a, thutak i zuikei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Himahleh amah vak a a om bang a ei leng vak a i omleh i kithuah chiat ua, huan a Tapa Jesu sisan in i khelhna tengteng a hon silsiangsak zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Khelhna ka neikei chi lehang eimah leh eimah i kikhem a, thutak eimah ah a omkei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />I khelhnate thupha i tawi leh, i khelhnate ngaidam ding leh i diktatlouhna tengteng silsiang ding in amah a muanhuai in a diktat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Thil ka hihkhial kei i chih leh amah zuauthei in i bawl ua, a thu leng eimau ah a omkei hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka naute aw thil na hihkhelh louhna ding un hiai thute na kiang uah ka gelh ahi. Kuapeuh in thil a hihkhelh leh Pa kiang a hon gensakpa, Jesu Khrist, mi diktat i nei hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amah i khelhnate thuphatawina ahi; eimah khelhna kia hilou in, khovel tengteng khelhna thuphatawina leng ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huan a thupiakte i zuih leh huai ah amah i thei chih i kithei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A thupiakte zuilou a “Amah ka thei” chi mi mi zuauthei ahi, thutak amah ah a omkei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kuapeuh a thuzui peuhmah amah ah Pathian a itna a kim petmah hi. Amah ah i om chih hiai ah i kithei ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amah ah ka om gige chi mi amah om bang in a omsam ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Deihtakte aw, thupiak thak na kiang uah ka gelh kei a: thupiak lui a tung a kipan a na neih uh ka gelhzaw ahi. Huai thupiak lui na thu theihsa pen uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Himahleh thupiak thak gelh hisam na veng, huai amah ah leh noumau ah a lang hi, mial a man lellel ziak in leh vak taktak tua a hongvak tak ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A unau haw napi a, vak ah ka om chi mi tutan in leng mial ah a om gige hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A unau itmi vak ah a om gige a, amah ah kipalpaihna ding san a omkei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A unau hawmi bel mial ah a om a, mial ah a khosa a, mial in a mit a tawtsak ziak in a paina leng a theikei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Naute aw, amah min ziak a na khelhnate uh ngaihdam a hihtak ziak in na kiang uah ka gelh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pate aw, amah a tung a kipan a om gige na theih ziak un na kiang uah ka gelh ahi. Tangvalte aw, Pathian thu noumau ah a om gige a, giloupa na zohtak ziak un na kiang uah ka gelh ahi. Naute aw, Pa na theih ziak un na kiang uah ka gelh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pate aw, amah a tung a kipan a om gige na theih ziak un na kiang uah ka gelh ahi. Tangvalte aw, na hat ua Pathian thu noumau ah a om gige a, migilou na zohtak ziak un na kiang uah ka gelh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Khovel it kei unla, khovel a thil omte leng it sam kei un. Mi kuapeuh in khovel a it leh Pa itna amah ah a omkei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Khovel a thil om tengteng, sa utnate, mit utnate, damsung thupina limte Pa a kipan ahi kei a, khovel a kipan ahizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Khovel, a utnate toh, a mangthang lellel ahi. Pathian deihlam hihmi bel tangtawn in a om gige ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Naute aw, hun nanungpen hita e, Khrist doupa a hongpai ding chih na zak bang un tuin leng Khrist doumi tampitak a hong pawtta uhi; huaiziak in hun nanungpen ahita chih i thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amaute i lak ua kipan in a pawt ua, himahleh eimah mi tak ahi kei uh; eimah mi tak hile uh i kiang uah a omsam ding uhi; himahleh avek un eimah mitak ahi kei uh chih a latchetna ding in a hon pawtsanta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mi Siangthou kiang a kipan thaunilhna na tang ua, bangkim na thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Thutak na theihlouh ziak ua ka gelh ahi kei a, na theih ziak uh leh thutak a zuau bangmah a pawt ngeilouh ziak in ka gelh ahizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Jesu, Khrist ahi chih gingtalou mi sang a zuauthei kua a om a? Khrist doumi tuh Pa leh Tapa gingtalou mi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Kuapeuh Tapa gingtalou in Pa leng a sang tuankei; Tapa gingta in bel Pa leng a sang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Nou zaw a tung a kipan a na zak uh noumau ah omsak gige un. Huai a tung a kipan a na zak uh noumau a a om gige leh nou leng Tapa leh Pa ah na om gige ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hiai ahi amah ngei in a honchiam pen; tangtawn hinna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Noumau hon pimang tumte tungtang na kiang uah ka gelh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Nou zaw amah kiang a kipan a thaunilhna na tan uh noumau ah a om gige a, kuamah hilh na kiphamoh kei uhi; amah thaunilhna in thil tengteng a hon hilhzawk ziak in leh thudik ahi a, zuau leng a hihlouh ziak in huai in nou a honhilh bang in amah ah om gige un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Huchi in naute aw, amah ah om gige un; amah a hong kilak chiang in ama ah zumlou in hangsantak in i om thei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Amah mi diktat ahi chih na theih uleh mi kuapeuh diktatna hihmi amah a suak ahi chih na thei uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ngai un, Pa hon itna thupi hina tel e! Pathian tate chih a i om; huai mah i hihna uh ahi hi. Hiai khong ziak in khovel in a hon theikei hi, amah a theihlouh ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Deihtakte aw, tun ah Pathian tate i hi ua, bangchi’n ahia i om ding chih bel a kithei tadih kei hi; amah a hong kilak chiang in, amah bang in i om ding chih i thei hi, amah a om ngeingei bangtak in i mu ding ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amah tung a lametna nei peuhmah amah a siangthou bang in a kihihsiangthou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kuapeuh thil hihkhial dan ah a talek hi; dan a tatlekna khelhna ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amah khelhnate lamang ding in a honglangta chih na thei uhi; Amah ah khelhna bangmah a omkei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kuapeuh amah a om gige in thil a hihkhial kei hi; kuapeuh thil hihkhial in amah a mu kei a, amah leng a theikei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tate aw, kuamah khem in omkei un. Diktatna hihmi amah a diktat mah bang in a diktat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Thil hihkhialmi Diabol a pawt ahi; Diabol in a tung a kipan thil a hihkhial hi. Pathian Tapa honglat napen Diabol nasepte a hih manthat theihna ding in ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kuapeuh Pathian a suak in Pathian chi amah a a om gige ziak in thil a hihkhial kei, Pathian a suak a hih ziak in, thil a hihkhial theikei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hiai ah Pathian tate leh Diabol tate a theihtheih hi; kuapeuh diktatna hihlou Pathian a suak ahi kei a, a unau itlou leng Pathian a suak ahi kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A tung a kipan thukhah na zak uh i ki-ittuah chiat ding uh chih ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kaina, giloupa a kipan amah unau thatpa bang in omkei ni. Bangziak in ahia a thah tak? Amah thilhihte a gilou a, a unau thilhihte a dik ziak in ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Naute aw, khovel in nou a honhuat leh lamdang sa kei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Unaute i it ziak in sihna a kipan in i pawt ua, hinna ah i lutta chih i thei uhi. Kuapeuh itna neilou sihna ah a omlai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kuapeuh a unau hua tualthat ahi; tualthatmi tangtawn hinna nei a omkei uh chih na thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hiai ah itna bang ahia chih i thei hi, aman tuh ei ading in a hinna a piaktak ziak in; en leng unaute ading in i hinna i piaksam ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Himahleh kuapeuh in khovel sum nei in, a unau tasam in mu taleh, amah lainat tuankei leh Pathian itna amah a bangchi’n a om ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Naute aw, thu kia in itkei ni, lei kia in leng itsam keini, thilhih leh chihtaktak in hi zaw hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hiai in thutak a suak i hi chih hon theisak a, amah ma ah i lungtang i muangsak thak ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />I lungtang in siamlouh a hon tansak dek chiang in chihna ahi; Pathian zaw i lungtangte sang in a lianzaw a thil bangkim a thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Deihtakte aw, i lungtang in siamlouh a hontan kei leh Pathian lam ah i hangsan hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A thupiakte i zuih ua, a mitmuh a thil kipahhuai i hih zel ziak in i nget peuhmah amah a kipan in i muzel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Huan a thupiak hiai ahi, a Tapa Jesu Khrist min gingta lehang, aman thu a honpiak bang in ki-ittuah chiat lai lehang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A thupiakte zuimi amah ah a om gige a, Amah mah leng amah ah a om gige hi. Huan Kha a honpiak ah amah eimau ah a om gige chih i thei uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Deihtakte aw, kha napeuh gingta kei un, himahleh khate Pathian a kipan ahi uhiam hilou chih chian un; zawlnei taklou tampi khovel a a na pawttak ziak un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hiai ah Pathian Kha na thei ding uh, bang kha peuh Jesu Khrist sa in a hongpai chih gum Pathian a kipan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bang kha peuh Jesu gumlou Pathian a kipan ahi kei; huai tuh Khrist doumi kha, hongpai ding na zak uh ahi; tuin khovel ah a om khinta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Naute aw, Pathian a kipan na hi ua, tuate na zouta uhi; noumau a om khovel a om sang a a thupizawk ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amau khovel a ahi ua; huaiziak in khovel a bang in a pau ua, khovel in a thu uh a ngaikhia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Eite Pathian a kipan i hi ua, Pathian thei mite’n i thu a ngaikhe zel uhi; Pathian a kipanlou mite’n i thu a ngaikhe kei uhi. Hiai ah thutak Kha leh thutaklou kha i thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Deihtakte aw, i ki-ittuah chiat ding uh; itna Pathian a suak ahi ngal a, michih itna nei peuhmah Pathian a suak ahi khin ua, Pathian a theilai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Itna neilou in Pathian a theikei; Pathian itna ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hiai ah Pathian itna i tung uah a honglangta hi, amah ziak a i hin theihna din Pathian in a Tapa neihsun khovel a a honsawlna ah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hiai ah itna a om, eite’n Pathian i it uh ka chi ahi kei, aman a hon it a, i khelhnate thuphatawina ding in, a Tapa a honsawl ka chi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Deihtakte aw, Pathian in huchitel a a hon it leh, eite leng i ki-ittuah chiat ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kuamah in chiklai mah in Pathian a mu ngeikei hi. I ki-ittuah chiat uleh Pathian eimau ah a om gige dia, a itna leng eimau ah a kimlai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amah ah i om gige chih leh amah eimau ah a om gige chih Kha a honpiak tak ziak in hiai ah i thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huan Pa in Tapa khovel Hondampa hihna nei in a honsawl chih i muta ua, i theisak uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kuapeuh Jesu Pathian Tapa ahi chi a gum amah ah Pathian a om gige a, amah leng Pathian ah a om gige hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pathian in eimau adia itna a nei chih i thei ua, i gingta lai uhi. Pathian itna ahi; itna a om gige mi Pathian ah a om gige a, Pathian leng amah ah a om gige hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hiai ah i tung uah itna a kimta, vaihawm ni ading a laulou a i om theihna ah; amah om bang a khovel a i om ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Itna ah launa a omkei, itna kim in lauhna a delhkhe zawzel hi, lauhna in gawtna a hon ngaihtuahsak; a laumi itna ah a bukim kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aman a hon it masak ziak in i it uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Min, “Pathian ka it” chi in a unau haw leh amah zuauthei ahi; a unau a muhsa bawn a it ken, Pathian a muh ngeilouhpi bangchi’n a it thei dia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amah kiang a kipan in hiai thupiak i nei uhi, kuapeuh in Pathian a it leh a unau leng a it sam ding chihna ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kuapeuh Jesu, Khrist ahi chih gingta Pathian suahsak ahi; kuapeuh a suaksakpa it in a suahsak leng a it nak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hiai ah Pathian tate i itna ah Pathian i it a, a thupiakte i zui chih i thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pathian i itna hiai ahi, a thupiakte i zuihna; a thupiakte a haksa ngal kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pathian suahsak peuh in khovel a zouzel hi; hiai ahi khovel tung a vualzohna, i ginna uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jesu Pathian Tapa ahi chih gingmi kia ngallou, kuan khovel a zouzel a?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hiai ahi tui leh sisan a hong paipa, Jesu Khrist; tui kia ah hilou in, tui ah leh sisan ah ahizaw. Theisakpa tuh Kha ahi, Kha thutak a hih ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Van tung ah theihpih thum a om a, Pa, Thu leh Kha Siangthou ahi ua, amaute khat ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Leitung ah theihpihtu thum a om uhi, Kha leh tui leh sisan; huai thumte a kithutuak uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mihing theihsakna bawn i san leh Pathian theihsakna a thupizaw hi. Pathian theihsakna tuh Ka Tapa tanchin ka theisakta chih ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pathian Tapa gingta min amah ah theihna a nei a, Pathian gingtalou min amah zuauthei in a bawl hi; Pathian in a Tapa tanchin a theihsak a gintak louh ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Theihsakna hiai ahi, Pathian in tangtawn hinna a honpia a, huai hinna a Tapa ah a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tapa nei in hinna a nei hi; Pathian Tapa neilou in hinna a neikei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tangtawn hinna na nei uh chih na theihna ding un, nou Pathian Tapa min gingtate kiang ah hiai thu ka gelh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hiai pen amah tung a i hangsanna ahi, bangpeuh amah deihlam bang a i nget leh aman a hon ngaihkhiak sak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huchi in bangpeuh i nget a hon ngaihkhiak sak chih i thei leh a kiang a i thilnget i muta chih i thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kuapeuh in a unau sihna khop hilou khelhna hih in mu leh a ngetsak ding, huchi in Pathian in a ngenmi kiang ah sihna khop hilou khelhna hihte ading in hinna a pe ding hi. Sihna khop khelhna a om a; huchibang lam ah a ngetsak ding ka chi ahi kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Diktatlouhna tengteng khelhna ahi; sihna khop hilou khelhna leng a omsam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kuapeuh Pathian suahsak in thil a hihkhial kei chih i thei hi; Pathian Tapa neihsun in amah a kem gige a, gilou pa’n khoih leng a khoih theikei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huan eite Pathian a kipan i hi chih i thei ua, khovel pumpi bel giloupa thuthu in a om chih i thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Huan Pathian Tapa a hongpai a, mi diktatpa i theihna ding in theihtheihna a honpia chih i thei behlap uhi; eite a Tapa Jesu Khrist a i om in mi diktatpa ah i om uhi. Amah Pathian diktak leh tangtawn hinna ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Naute aw, milim lak ah kihemkhia un, Amen.
  </para>
</usx>
